package war:ime-keyboard@0.1.0;

/// war.ime.keyboard's world. Includes the canonical skiko-ui imports
/// (Canvas / Paragraph / Keyboard.sendKeyEvent / ...) plus the
/// IME-events export (`war:ime/ime` — `on-editor-attached` /
/// `on-editor-detached`) the host calls when focus changes.
///
/// `include war:ime/ime-events` (stripped sibling of `ime-client-world`
/// that omits the input-connection import) — see wit/ime.wit. We don't
/// use war:ime/input-connection; key events go through the existing
/// my:skiko-gfx/keyboard outbound path (task 47 step 3b).
world ime-keyboard {
    include my:skiko-gfx/skiko-ui@0.1.0;
    include war:ime/ime-events@0.1.0;
}
